A project fact said in passing inside a plan: while the agent works through
three todos, the user mentions that staging moved. Closing the plan pops its
frame, which removes everything said since it was entered from the agent's
context, that line included. Asked about staging right after, the agent
must answer from mem, so it has to have kept the move as a fact.

-- project/go.mod --
module app

go 1.22
-- project/client.go --
// Package main is a tiny client for the app's API.
package main

import "net/http"

// Fetch asks the API for path.
func Fetch(base, path string) (*http.Response, error) {
	return http.Get(base + path)
}
-- project/main.go --
package main

import (
	"fmt"
	"os"
)

func main() {
	resp, err := Fetch("https://staging.acme.test", "/health")
	if err != nil {
		fmt.Fprintln(os.Stderr, err)
		os.Exit(1)
	}
	fmt.Println(resp.Status)
}
